config INPUT_PIMORONI_SCALER
	bool "Pimoroni input coordinate scaler"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_PIMORONI_INPUT_SCALER_ENABLED
	depends on INPUT
	help
	  Pseudo input device that subscribes to absolute-axis events from another
	  input device and re-reports them scaled by num/denom, passing other
	  events through unchanged. Used to map the Presto's FT6236 panel-space
	  (~0-480) touch coordinates onto a half-resolution 240x240 display before
	  the LVGL pointer glue clamps them to the display bounds.
